        "original_id": "681873b7-e28c-5f7c-b75f-fc3ba7cc65ca",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Amybeth McNulty, Lucy Maud Montgomery, Moira Walley-Beckett, Dalila Bela\n- TV series: Anne, Anne with an E, Odd Squad, Once Upon a Time\n- Organizations: CBC, Netflix, PBS Kids\n- Works: Anne of Green Gables\n\nFacts:\n- In 1908, Lucy Maud Montgomery published the novel Anne of Green Gables.\n- Anne is a Canadian television series based on the 1908 novel Anne of Green Gables by Lucy Maud Montgomery.\n- Anne is titled Anne with an E on Netflix.\n- Moira Walley-Beckett adapted Anne as the series' Emmy Award-winning writer and producer.\n- In 2017, Amybeth McNulty starred as Anne Shirley in the CBC and Netflix series Anne.\n- Dalila Bela was born on October 5, 2001.\n- Dalila Bela is a Canadian actress.\n- Dalila Bela is known for playing Agent Olive on the PBS Kids series Odd Squad.\n- Dalila Bela is also known for work on the television shows Once Upon a Time and Anne.",
